I’m seeing the same failure with OpenCode Desktop 1.18.7. Using Kimi 3 on OpenRouter (through moonshot).

Ex:
Vercel’s official MCP server. get_web_analytics schema defines:

"since": {
  "type": ["string", "number"]
},
"until": {
  "$ref": "#/properties/since"
}

If the tool is advertised it seems Kimi rejects the provided tool catalog in full.

[Moonshot AI] Invalid request: tools.function.parameters is not a valid moonshot flavored json schema, details: <At path 'properties.until.$ref': references must start with #/$defs/>

did u try to disable ai title generation in opencode?
opencode/opencode.json 

```
"agent": {
  "title": {
    "disable": true
  }
}
```
